### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Ben Foulen",
  "prenom" : "Foulen",
  "email": "foulenmpatientmedecin0011@example.com",
  "motDePasse": "000000000",
  "confirmMotDePasse": "000000000",
  "image": "mari.png",
  "role": "MEDECIN"
}
###
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "foulenmpatientn@example.com",
  "motDePasse": "123456"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom" : "BM",
  "prenom": "Meriam",
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "8888",
  "confirmPassword": "8888",
  "image": "meary5.png"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1



